    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> and target bean.",
      "translation": "根据给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"类或接口 in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 和目标 Bean，创建一个新的 <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support 包中的类\"><code>ETag</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../PersistentEntityResource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc\"><code>PersistentEntityResource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a href=\"../PersistentEntityResource.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.PersistentEntityResource\"><code>PersistentEntityResource</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support.ETag\"><code>ETag</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Adds the current <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> to the given headers.",
      "translation": "将当前的 <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support 中的类\"><code>ETag</code></a> 添加到指定的标头中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Verifies the ETag to be created for the given target bean with the current one and raises a\n<a href=\"ETagDoesntMatchException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETagDoesntMatchException</code></a> in case they don't match.",
      "translation": "验证为给定目标 Bean 创建的 ETag 与当前 ETag 是否匹配，若不匹配则抛出 <a href=\"ETagDoesntMatchException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETagDoesntMatchException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>target</code> - can be null.",
      "translation": "<code>target</code> - 可为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
