    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> value. Falls back to <a href=\"#NO_ETAG\"><code>NO_ETAG</code></a> in case\nnull is provided.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>String</code></a> 值创建一个新的 <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a>。如果提供的是 null，则回退到 <a href=\"#NO_ETAG\"><code>NO_ETAG</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> matches the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> and target. A more dissenting way of\nchecking matches as it does not match if the ETag is <a href=\"#NO_ETAG\"><code>NO_ETAG</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回 <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> 是否与给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 和目标匹配。这是一种更为严格的匹配检查方式，因为如果 ETag 为 <a href=\"#NO_ETAG\"><code>NO_ETAG</code></a>，则不会匹配。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> value.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 值创建一个新的 <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support 中的类\"><code>ETag</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> matches the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> and target.",
      "translation": "返回 <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> 是否与给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 和目标匹配。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A value object to represent ETags.",
      "translation": "用于表示 ETag 的值对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/HttpHeaders.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http\"><code>HttpHeaders</code></a> with the ETag header been set if the current <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> instance is not\n        <a href=\"#NO_ETAG\"><code>NO_ETAG</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果当前的 <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> 实例不是 <a href=\"#NO_ETAG\"><code>NO_ETAG</code></a>，则设置 ETag 标头的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/HttpHeaders.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http\"><code>HttpHeaders</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"ETagDoesntMatchException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\">ETagDoesntMatchException</a></code> - in case the calculated <a href=\"ETag.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ETag</code></a> for the given bean does not match the current\n          one.",
